{"id":"cc229e8cc77734ec","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-ci-anti-localization-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC CI Anti Localization Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-ci-anti-localization-cardinal — ZFC CI Anti Localization Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-anti-localization-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-anti-localization-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-anti-localization-cardinal — ZFC CI Anti Localization Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-sequences]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-anti-localization-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-anti-localization-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-anti-localization-cardinal — ZFC CI Anti Localization Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ea3fa70993b84c0\" href=\"?note=9ea3fa70993b84c0\" title=\"58-df-sequences\">58-df-sequences</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{aloc}\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak{aloc}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^\\omega\">\\(h\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^\\omega\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Slalom}_h\">\\(\\mathrm{Slalom}_h\\)</span> is the set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>-bounded slaloms defined below</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiAntiLocalizationCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiAntiLocalizationCardinal}_S\\)</span> is the two-place predicate defined below</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\">\\(\\min C\\)</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\">\\(m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\\)</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>；此记号仅在其非空域使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}anti\\text{-}localization\\text{-}slalom} \\vdash \\mathrm{Slalom}_h\\coloneqq\\left\\{s\\in([\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega})^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(|s(n)|\\leq h(n)\\bigr)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}anti\\text{-}localization\\text{-}slalom} \\vdash \\mathrm{Slalom}_h\\coloneqq\\left\\{s\\in([\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega})^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(|s(n)|\\leq h(n)\\bigr)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}anti\\text{-}localization\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiAntiLocalizationCardinal}_S(\\mathfrak{aloc},h) \\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{aloc}=\\min\\bigl\\{|\\mathcal F|:\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Slalom}_h\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)\\notin s(n))\\bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}anti\\text{-}localization\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiAntiLocalizationCardinal}_S(\\mathfrak{aloc},h) \\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{aloc}=\\min\\bigl\\{|\\mathcal F|:\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Slalom}_h\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)\\notin s(n))\\bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the eventually-avoiding anti-localization cardinal for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>-bounded slaloms; it is unrelated to algebraic ring localization.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sequences","status":"resolved","id":"9ea3fa70993b84c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sequences]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 对集合 $A$ 和序数 $\\lambda$，$[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}$，$[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{aloc}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Slalom}_h","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiAntiLocalizationCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\min C","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}anti\\text{-}localization\\text{-}slalom} \\vdash \\mathrm{Slalom}_h\\coloneqq\\left\\{s\\in([\\omega]^{<\\omega})^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(|s(n)|\\leq h(n)\\bigr)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}anti\\text{-}localization\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiAntiLocalizationCardinal}_S(\\mathfrak{aloc},h) \\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{aloc}=\\min\\bigl\\{|\\mathcal F|:\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Slalom}_h\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)\\notin s(n))\\bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"h","display":false}],"bytes":1883,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1600","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-ci-anti-localization-cardinal.md|58-df-zfc-ci-anti-localization-cardinal]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","9ea3fa70993b84c0","2be08d4ee8aa1590","5582a281f15a33c2"]}